        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86912, Westwood Back-to-Back Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in an impressive array of beautiful finishes, the Emtek Back-to-Back Westwood Front Door Handle Pair will be a great addition to your traditional home. The barrel middle design has long been a favorite among home designers for its classic allure. The Westwood Back-to-Back Handle Pair comes in your choice of 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. The set is packaged with two door handles and the hardware to mount them back-to-back on doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/westwood-thru-bolt-door-pull-emtek-86912\"><b>Westwood Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Back-to-Back Westwood Front Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) door pulls,  (2) 2-1/2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) #10-32 set screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86912-specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\"><b>Emtek Westwood Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86912:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86913:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
